| [ChartPanel.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Oshan/Pictures/auqa360/frontend/src/components/ChartPanel.jsx) | Chart wrapper for historical data visualization |
| [DetectionCard.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Oshan/Pictures/auqa360/frontend/src/components/DetectionCard.jsx) | Shows YOLO fish detection results |
| [Navbar.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Oshan/Pictures/auqa360/frontend/src/components/Navbar.jsx) | Top navigation with links to all pages + notification bell |

